- decided_at: 2026-10-07T18:25:50+00:00
  event: initial
  value: Captured Unix commands start in a new session with Setsid; interactive host UI launches retain their terminal.
  reason: A PTY reproduction showed zsh suspending under Setpgid; Setsid preserves startup definitions and group cancellation while removing controlling-terminal interference. Disabling interactive startup loses aliases; disabling job control alone leaves direct tty access.
